    ("p", "Wagbook gives you a seasonal tip with this advice on 1 December, so you can start in time. If your vet prescribes something, add it to Wagbook with its dose and time, so you give it at the right moment. And write down in the diary how it went, so next year you know what helped."),
    ("p", "<em>This article is general information, not veterinary advice. If your pet is very anxious, talk to your vet.</em>"),
